 R←Test_22(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;expected;r
⍝ `SetTrap` builds the ⎕TRAP expression from the namespace HandleError actually lives in
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 #.⎕SHADOW'HandleErrorParms'
 #.HandleErrorParms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 expected←(⍕##.HandleError),'.Process ⍬'

 r←1 ##.HandleError.SetTrap ⍬
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢r
 →T.PassesIf(0 'E'expected)≡⊃r

 r←1 ##.HandleError.SetTrap''
 →T.PassesIf(0 'E'expected)≡⊃r

 r←1 ##.HandleError.SetTrap'#.HandleErrorParms'
 →T.PassesIf(0 'E'((⍕##.HandleError),'.Process ''#.HandleErrorParms'''))≡⊃r

 :If APLTreeUtils2.IsDevelopment
     →T.PassesIf((0 1000)'S')≡##.HandleError.SetTrap'#.HandleErrorParms'
 :EndIf

 R←T._OK
